  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protect,Feed $Educate A needy Child in rural Kenya</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In this project we are looking to raise $16k to buy 2 acres of land in rural Kenya, so that the CBO Township Foundation Education Centre can become self sufficient in the provision of 2 x nutritious meals per day to 475 children from impoverished, mainly orphaned, backgrounds. Currently they&apos;re only receiving one meal a day of essentially just porridge which is nutritionally deficient over the long term .Let&apos;s get together to GIVE during this TX&apos;s-giving, we all deserve a nice and a healthy meal</narrative>
  </description>
